{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_readme", "label": "README (especificaci\u00f3n en espa\u00f1ol)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_rn_monthly_quota", "label": "RN-01..RN-06 Meta mensual", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "1.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Meta base 8; semana con festivo o d\u00eda libre tiene cuota 1; semanas que cruzan de mes solo cuentan d\u00edas del mes visible para que ning\u00fan d\u00eda sume en dos meses."}, {"id": "readme_rn_slack_must", "label": "RN-07..RN-10 Margen y d\u00edas obligatorios", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "1.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Margen = d\u00edas h\u00e1biles libres \u2212 visitas que faltan; lo que manda es la meta del mes, no las 2 por semana. Con margen \u2264 0 todos los libres son obligatorios."}, {"id": "readme_rn_marking", "label": "RN-11..RN-13 Marcar d\u00edas (ciclo de toques, deshacer 5 s, solo local)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "1.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_rn_holidays", "label": "RN-14 Festivos de Colombia (fijos, Ley Emiliani, Semana Santa)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "1.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_ley_emiliani", "label": "Ley Emiliani", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "1.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_rn_reminders", "label": "RN-15..RN-19 Avisos diarios y verificaci\u00f3n", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "sourc